{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"Your Content.On Autopilot.\n      66 niches. Zero filming. You collect the views.\n      Launch Your Channel\n    \n    \n      A — Cinematic Void\n      Inspired by: Runway + Framer\n      Pure black canvas. Content floats in the void. Tight, compressed headlines with negative letter-spacing. The product screenshots ARE the design — everything else retreats. One accent color (fire orange), used surgically. Uppercase labels, dramatic scale contrast. Feels like a film studio, not a SaaS.\n      Best for: making DragonMadeIt feel premium and serious. The \"this tool means business\" vibe.","choice":"cinematic","id":null,"timestamp":1776348397327}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"DragonMadeIt\n          The facelesscontent enginefor TikTok.\n          66 niches. AI scripts. Auto-posting. From $15/mo. No camera needed.\n        \n        \n          This week\n          7 videos\n          12.4K views\n        \n      \n    \n    \n      C — Editorial Magazine\n      Inspired by: Vercel + Runway (editorial mode)\n      Asymmetric layouts. Serif display font mixed with sans-serif body. Newspaper-like information density with generous white space around it. The site reads like a well-designed magazine article about automation. Uppercase brand labels, dramatic size contrast between headings and body. Side-by-side content blocks instead of stacked sections.\n      Best for: standing out from every other SaaS. The \"this doesn't look like any tool I've seen\" vibe. Most distinctive but most work.","choice":"editorial","id":null,"timestamp":1776348442569}
