{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"C\n      Chapter Book\n      The page is divided into distinct \"chapters\" separated by full-width dividers with chapter labels (like \"01 — How It Works\"). Each chapter has its own layout rhythm — one might be a split, another a full-bleed image, another a text column. Creates a reading experience, like scrolling through a well-designed pitch deck. The user feels like they're reading a story, not scanning a landing page.\n      Inspired by: Ferrari/Lamborghini editorial + pitch decks\n    \n    \n      NAV\n      HERO HEADLINE+ CTA\n      01 — THE PROBLEM\n      \n        PAIN POINT TEXT\n        COMPARISON\n      \n      02 — HOW IT WORKS\n      FULL-WIDTH DASHBOARD DEMO\n      03 — WHAT YOU GET\n      \n        FEATURE\n        FEATURE\n      \n      04 — PRICING\n      PRICING\n      CTA + TESTIMONIALS\n      FOOTER","choice":"c","id":null,"timestamp":1776348657006}
